<title>BELGIUM: Sabena in maintenance deal with  Biman.</title>
<headline>Sabena in maintenance deal with  Biman.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabena Technics, a unit of Belgian flag carrier Sabena, will provide long-term maintenance for  Biman Bangladesh Airline's Airbus A310-300 aircraft, Sabena said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Sabena said it would station engineers at Dhaka airport, Bangladesh, to ensure line and light maintenance on site.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
